# pkgdown
# NOTE: the built site under docs/r/ is deliberately COMMITTED -- GitHub Pages
# serves this repo from the `docs/` folder on `main`, so ignoring
# docs/r/reference/ or docs/r/articles/ would publish a site whose Reference
# and Articles links 404. `pkgdown/` is likewise tracked, so favicon/logo and
# extra.css can be committed.

